A master lich can cast finger of death, so if you don't have magic
resistance already, the prudent thing to do would be run away, and come
back when you have MR, or some other means to neutralize the lich's
magical attack, i.e. wands of cancellation or polymorph.

But if you still want to take on the lich without MR, I would suggest
luring it downstairs, then fighting it while standing on the downstairs
of the lower level, which will prevent it from teleporting away to heal.

